# Production S3 Remote State Backend with DynamoDB State Locking
# To use this in CI/CD or production:
# 1. Create S3 bucket: cloudpulse-terraform-state-<account-id>
# 2. Create DynamoDB table: cloudpulse-terraform-locks (Partition key: LockID [String])
# 3. Rename this file to backend.tf and run: terraform init -reconfigure

